# Redis Configuration (Upstash)
# Get your free Upstash Redis account at https://upstash.com

# Upstash Redis URL (get from Upstash dashboard)
REDIS_URL=https://xyz-company-12345.upstash.io

# Upstash Redis Token (get from Upstash dashboard)
REDIS_TOKEN=your_upstash_token_here

# If Redis is not configured, the app falls back to in-memory caching
# In-memory caching works identically but is not shared across instances